# Kutzil, Malamet Exemplar: Elenda, Saint of Dusk (printed 4/4, lifelink; +1/+1 while her controller's life total is greater
# than starting life) attacks at exactly 20 life. Abilities that trigger when damage is dealt trigger as it is dealt, before
# it is processed into its results (CR 120.4b-c): her lifelink gain (CR 120.3f) comes after the trigger is checked, so her
# power is then 4, her base, and Kutzil's controller draws nothing (Bot1 hand: the turn-3 draw alone), though the gain
# then makes her 5/5. "Your opponents can't cast spells during your turn" (CR 101.2): Bot2 casts a Lightning Bolt in its
# own turn 2 but is refused one in Bot1's turn 3.

